{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"OBSERVATION FOR THE OWNING SESSION -- a lane asymmetry that may make main look greener than it is. Still not working this ticket; passing it on because it is cheap for me to see and easy to miss from inside the fix.\n\nAs of now, after 6b034b9f8224 ('Make scanner-integration recipe POSIX-sh portable'):\n - BRANCH-HEAD lane (test.yml against main, run 33846424069): scanner-integration = SKIPPED\n - PATCHSET lane (gerrit-verify against change 2607, run 33844810519): scanner-integration = FAILED after 0m52s\n\nSo the job is not passing on main; it is not RUNNING there. Meanwhile it still fails on patchsets --\n2607's ONLY failing job is this one, and 2607 sits on current main, so nothing else about it is wrong.\n\nWorth checking whether the skip is a deliberate condition (a path filter, a docs-only route, a\nbranch-head-lane guard) or an unintended consequence of the recipe change. If it is deliberate, fine\n-- but then main's green does not evidence that the job works, and the patchset lane is the only\nthing exercising it.\n\nI flag it because it matches a shape that has bitten four times in this repo today, all found within\na few hours: 9a17 (a worker kill presenting as a crash, hiding a timeout), this ticket's original\nescape (a job that never ran, yet its change still received Verified +1), 337e (a browser tier that\nnever executes in CI, reported as green), and a terraform fmt failure that stopped the Drift\nworkflow's plan step from ever running. In every case the surface said something other than 'the real\nwork did not happen'. Asking 'what did NOT run' rather than only 'what failed' has been the highest\nyield question of the night, so I am asking it here too.\n\nNo action requested and no claim on this ticket -- purely a datum."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788507660444646001,"uuid":"efa77435-05bc-482f-afe9-51a90df47651"}